---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Mr. Swain — AI Developer & Automation Engineer"
  description="Mr. Swain is an AI Developer, Automation Engineer, and LLM Integration Specialist based in Atlanta, GA. Former Capgemini business analyst, now building AI systems for modern businesses."
>

  <!-- ── Hero (dark) ── -->
  <section class="section-dark">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 py-24 lg:py-32">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="section-label">About</p>
        <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-black mb-7 leading-tight text-[var(--color-text)]">
          Builds AI That Ships.<br />
          <span class="gradient-text">Not Just Demos.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-[var(--color-dim)] leading-relaxed">
          Mr. Swain is an AI Developer, Automation Engineer, LLM Integration Specialist, and Business Analyst based in Atlanta, GA — with 7+ years of experience across enterprise consulting, private AI development, and full-stack technical build.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Philosophy (light) ── -->
  <section class="section-light">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 py-28">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-start">
        <div class="reveal-left">
          <p class="section-label">Philosophy</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black mb-7 text-[var(--color-onyx)]">
            End-to-End or<br /><span class="gradient-text">Nothing</span>
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-5 text-[var(--color-onyx)]/65 leading-relaxed text-[1.05rem]">
            <p>
              Most AI projects fail not because the models aren't good enough — they fail because the gap between prototype and production never gets closed. Requirements are vague. Data quality is ignored. Accuracy thresholds are never defined. Monitoring never gets built. Nobody owns the edge cases.
            </p>
            <p>
              I don't build prototypes that live in notebooks. Every system I design is built for the real world: clear requirements, validated against real data, deployed to infrastructure that runs, monitored for drift, and documented so it can be maintained.
            </p>
            <p>
              That combination — technical depth plus business context — is what separates an AI system that genuinely reduces cost from one that demonstrates nicely and then gets abandoned.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal-right space-y-4">
          {[
            { label: 'AI Development',         value: 95 },
            { label: 'Python / LangChain',      value: 90 },
            { label: 'Business Analysis',       value: 95 },
            { label: 'Cloudflare Deployment',   value: 90 },
            { label: 'LLM Prompt Engineering',  value: 95 },
            { label: 'TypeScript / React',      value: 85 },
          ].map(item => (
            <div>
              <div class="flex justify-between mb-2">
                <span class="text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-onyx)]">{item.label}</span>
                <span class="text-sm font-mono text-[var(--color-onyx)]/45">{item.value}%</span>
              </div>
              <div class="skill-bar-track">
                <div class="skill-bar-fill" style={`width:${item.value}%`}></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Experience (dark) ── -->
  <section class="section-dark">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 py-28">
      <div class="reveal-up mb-14">
        <p class="section-label">Experience</p>
        <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-[var(--color-text)]">
          Professional <span class="gradient-text">History</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-0 relative before:absolute before:left-4 sm:before:left-6 before:top-2 before:bottom-2 before:w-px before:bg-[var(--color-border)]">
        {[
          {
            role: 'Webmaster & AI Developer',
            company: 'Empire Tours & Productions',
            period: 'Feb 2025 – Jul 2025',
            color: '#C8A96E',
            highlights: [
              'Revamped digital infrastructure with AI-powered content personalization and chatbot automation.',
              'Designed and deployed a GPT-based virtual assistant handling customer inquiries and scheduling.',
              'Automated backend workflows for SEO, analytics, bookings, and content updates.',
              'Built real-time dashboards surfacing marketing and engagement insights.',
              'Improved reporting speed and operational visibility across the business.',
            ],
          },
          {
            role: 'AI Developer / Business Analyst',
            company: 'Private Client',
            period: 'Aug 2022 – Dec 2023',
            color: '#A78BFA',
            highlights: [
              'Designed and implemented end-to-end AI automations using GPT and LangChain-style workflows.',
              'Built AI agents for document parsing, lead management, and CRM workflow automation.',
              'Integrated Python tools with Salesforce pipelines, analytics, and customer reporting.',
              'Delivered AI strategy recommendations aligned with measurable business outcomes.',
              'Improved team productivity and reduced repetitive processing through automation.',
            ],
          },
          {
            role: 'Business Analyst',
            company: 'Capgemini',
            period: 'Apr 2019 – Jul 2022',
            color: '#34D399',
            highlights: [
              'Supported enterprise digital transformation involving CRM, automation, dashboards, and process modernization.',
              'Gathered requirements, created user stories, conducted gap analyses, and supported Agile delivery.',
              'Used Jira, Azure DevOps, Salesforce, Power BI, and process documentation in daily work.',
              'Aligned stakeholders across global teams in security-conscious enterprise environments.',
              'Delivered KPI tracking frameworks and dashboard solutions for business intelligence.',
            ],
          },
        ].map((exp, i) => (
          <div class="reveal-up relative pl-10 sm:pl-14 pb-12" style={`--delay:${i*80}ms`}>
            <div class="absolute left-2 sm:left-4 top-1.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full border-2 bg-[var(--color-bg)] flex items-center justify-center" style={`border-color:${exp.color}`}>
              <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full" style={`background:${exp.color}`}></div>
            </div>
            <div class="card p-7">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-5">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-bold text-[var(--color-text)] text-lg">{exp.role}</h3>
                  <p class="text-[var(--color-dim)] font-medium mt-0.5">{exp.company} — Atlanta, GA</p>
                </div>
                <span class="badge badge-gold font-mono">{exp.period}</span>
              </div>
              <ul class="space-y-2.5">
                {exp.highlights.map(h => (
                  <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-[var(--color-dim)]">
                    <span class="text-[var(--color-gold)] mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-xs">▸</span>
                    {h}
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Education (light) ── -->
  <section class="section-light">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 py-24">
      <div class="reveal-up mb-12">
        <p class="section-label">Education</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-[var(--color-onyx)]">Academic <span class="gradient-text">Background</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5" data-stagger-parent>
        {[
          {
            degree: 'Full Stack Web Development Certificate',
            school: 'Georgia Institute of Technology',
            icon: `<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"/>`,
          },
          {
            degree: 'A.A.S., Information Technology',
            school: 'Chattahoochee Technical College',
            icon: `<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 17.25v1.007a3 3 0 01-.879 2.122L7.5 21h9l-.621-.621A3 3 0 0115 18.257V17.25m6-12V15a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 013 15V5.25m18 0A2.25 2.25 0 0018.75 3H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 5.25m18 0H3"/>`,
          },
          {
            degree: 'High School Diploma',
            school: 'East Coweta High School',
            icon: `<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.26 10.147a60.436 60.436 0 00-.491 6.347A48.627 48.627 0 0112 20.904a48.627 48.627 0 018.232-4.41 60.46 60.46 0 00-.491-6.347m-15.482 0a50.57 50.57 0 00-2.658-.813A59.905 59.905 0 0112 3.493a59.902 59.902 0 0110.399 5.84c-.896.248-1.783.52-2.658.814m-15.482 0A50.697 50.697 0 0112 13.489a50.702 50.702 0 017.74-3.342M6.75 15a.75.75 0 100-1.5.75.75 0 000 1.5zm0 0v-3.675A55.378 55.378 0 0112 8.443m-7.007 11.55A5.981 5.981 0 006.75 15.75v-1.5"/>`,
          },
        ].map((edu, i) => (
          <div class="reveal-scale card-light p-6 flex gap-4 items-start" style={`--delay:${i*100}ms`} data-stagger>
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-lg bg-[var(--color-onyx)] text-[var(--color-gold)] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0" set:html={edu.icon}></div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-onyx)] text-sm leading-tight mb-1">{edu.degree}</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-onyx)]/50">{edu.school}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── CTA (dark) ── -->
  <section class="section-dark">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 py-24">
      <div class="reveal-up max-w-xl">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-black mb-5 text-[var(--color-text)]">Ready to work together?</h2>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-dim)] mb-10 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Whether it's a full AI automation build, a consulting engagement, or a targeted workflow fix — I'd like to hear about your project.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Hire Mr. Swain</a>
          <a href="/resume" class="btn-outline">View Resume</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
